{"id":"1ee647377ebdd590","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-polynomial-projection.md","title":"0–1 Polynomial Projection Reduction","display":"df-polynomial-projection — 0–1 Polynomial Projection Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-polynomial-projection","aliases":["28-df-polynomial-projection"],"display":"df-polynomial-projection — 0–1 Polynomial Projection Reduction","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 16.10","source_printed_pages":"325","source_pdf_pages":"351","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-polynomial-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-polynomial-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-projection — 0–1 Polynomial Projection Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 16.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"325"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"351"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathbb F[Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m]\">\\(g\\in\\mathbb F[Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m]\\)</span>；0、1为该域常量。</li>\n<li>本条按书中严格0/1版本，投影不能任意代入其他域常量或非平凡多项式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\le_{\\operatorname{proj}}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma:\\{Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m\\}\\to\\{0,1,X_1,\\ldots,X_n\\}\\quad f=g(\\sigma(Y_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(Y_m)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\le_{\\operatorname{proj}}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma:\\{Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m\\}\\to\\{0,1,X_1,\\ldots,X_n\\}\\quad f=g(\\sigma(Y_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(Y_m)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同时替换是多项式环同态确定的唯一结果；在有限域也以形式多项式相等判定，而不只比较域上函数值。保留原书严格0/1变元投影，与常见允许任意域常数的推广分开。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 16.10；印刷页 325；PDF 页 351。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 0–1 Polynomial Projection Reduction，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathbb F[Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m]","display":false},{"tex":"f\\le_{\\operatorname{proj}}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma:\\{Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m\\}\\to\\{0,1,X_1,\\ldots,X_n\\}\\quad f=g(\\sigma(Y_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(Y_m)).","display":true}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}